1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/computer-net/net-data-journey","children":["网络数据包的完整旅程：从发送到接收的全过程"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"计算机基础"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"网络数据包的完整旅程：从发送到接收的全过程"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"通过一个 HTTP 请求与响应，深入探索背后的网络通信机制，从 DNS 解析、TCP 连接到数据封装与传输，全面解析数据包如何穿越局域网与公网到达目标服务器。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-03-01T12:58:37.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/03/01"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","3,650"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":"不知道你是否曾经好奇你发出的一个网络请求，最终是怎么到达对端，并将你想要的信息返回给你的。本文将通过一个 HTTP 请求与响应，从一个比较宏观的角度来梳理下一个数据包在网络中的旅途，旨在帮助笔者和各位读者建立起对计算机网络模型一个比较全面的认知。"}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"本文参考极客时间《网络架构实战课（谢友鹏）》，再根据笔者的知识面、按照个人理解，补充更多丰富具体的内容。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"实战","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#实战","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#实战"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"实战","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":4,"offset":184},"end":{"line":5,"column":6,"offset":186}}}]},"children":"实战"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["好，那我们直接开始，我们先使用 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"curl"}]," 来发起一个 HTTP 请求，看看这过程中发生了什么："]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-0",{"data-language":"SH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-sh","children":"curl -o /dev/null -v https://example.com\n"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"在笔者的 mac 机器上，这行命令的输出如下："}],"\n",["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250301131247066.png","data-fancybox":"true","alt":"curl https//example.com 结果分析","style":{"width":"100%","height":"auto"},"node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250301131247066.png","dataFancybox":"true","alt":"curl https//example.com 结果分析","style":"width: 100%; height: auto;"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":316},"end":{"line":15,"column":182,"offset":497}}}}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["当我们发起请求时，首先会对 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"example.com"}]," 进行域名解析，分别尝试解析到它的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"IPv6"}]," 和 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"IPv4"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-1",{"data-language":"BASH","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-bash","children":"* IPv6: (none)\n* IPv4: 23.215.0.138, 96.7.128.198, 23.192.228.80, 23.192.228.84, 23.215.0.136, 96.7.128.175\n"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":["因为我们使用的是 ",["$","code","code-0",{"className":"$undefined","children":"https"}]," 协议，所以会尝试跟这些地址的 ",["$","code","code-1",{"className":"$undefined","children":"443"}]," 端口建立 ",["$","code","code-2",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TCP"}]," 连接，（如果是 ",["$","code","code-3",{"className":"$undefined","children":"https"}]," 则跟 ",["$","code","code-4",{"className":"$undefined","children":"80"}]," 端口），并进行 ",["$","code","code-5",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TLS 握手验证"}],"，如果成功了，则会建立 ",["$","code","code-6",{"className":"$undefined","children":"TCP"}]," 连接。"]}],"\n",["$","pre","pre-2",{"data-language":"GO","children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"hljs language-go","children":["*   Trying ",["$","span","span-0",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"23.215"}],["$","span","span-1",{"className":"hljs-number","children":".0"}],["$","span","span-2",{"className":"hljs-number","children":".138"}],":",["$","span","span-3",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"443."}],"..\n...[TLS handshake]\n* Connected to example.com (",["$","span","span-4",{"className":"hljs-number","children":"23.215"}],["$","span","span-5",{"className":"hljs-number","children":".0"}],["$","span","span-6",{"className":"hljs-number","children":".138"}],") port ","$L9","\n"]}]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43"]}]}],"$L44","$L45","$L46"]}],"$L47"]}]]}]}]
